務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220217/571016858636259328652819.jpeg/7CCNuVa3rF8OdsLAhYlyyCrW-Ly0cCidQPj-ZED4_mQ\"/><figcaption>理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220217/571016861031337984547968.jpeg/pJwHdUvWydv_wlPpHqFR6VVvn7zugAyzp0aR5qdGkeY\"/><figcaption>理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220217/571016863346724864942516.jpeg/v_xZMt9h2DipARbgxXiJndUfqiMwtGuXm4Gy15uBstc\"/><figcaption>理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220217/571016865876021248084391.jpeg/nUx3Lzr9ozPoSGaEhkocDxrz_AabyB-l5gOOxOYDjsQ\"/><figcaption>理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220217/571016868149465088970536.jpeg/y5OqTeVT50w5aOzW_QKbr9B6DsNUwcAmUMKM2FDCjNg\"/><figcaption>理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220217/571016870649401344937548.jpeg/ehLbt6phztYhGR9feT2J94oEXpaeMmPX5fa7f-X2u38\"/><figcaption>理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220217/571016872985759744361827.jpeg/0vF4nPpwgAKiDSAqE6ckyHGJnCZlznn6jt48-I7ePPg\"/><figcaption>理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220217/571016850909958144045389.jpeg/JUQjuIXSwIOBjkVLNUy-8r-_Q4BE-iCs0FsJttBbCbY\"/><figcaption>理財｜另類方式定義務務自由，即睇有哪9個階段！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>不過，另一派網友則提醒，裸辭看似自由，但仍要考慮長遠未來：</p><p>「10萬元現在夠，但要考慮通膨，而且一旦辭職，人很容易懶」</p><p>「建議換工作，但不要沒工作，有現金流才能讓人放心，也不會無聊」</p><p>「好不容易考到教職，應該先保留，可以選擇換到輕鬆一點的學校，像是比較小的學校繼續服務」</p><p>也有人分享自身經驗，認為即使被動收入夠高，仍不一定代表適合完全不上班。一名網友表示：</p><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297011222089728049781.jpeg/IcyX8vzEblOSb-ZclkQBhsoM20eWq_VpV_rOMVf6zjE\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297013487144960921046.jpeg/v86RxT9TMaS0cTQxh0EMsPHLSLscAEpYfX8REn1_ERI\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297015651536896381256.jpeg/cP_5IBJdxin5IDFQNHt-KMD_yGoaFLi4ny3HwZ8tx8E\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297017962729472162703.jpeg/LpJHwMlfc25QYotu9btWg3Eq_8eunBkdZGSz0WRks9E\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297020122927104704382.jpeg/mK3u9AHF__gcOFP16uPXIj6JQI4Y5I0gc561aHOetWg\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297022811607040128043.jpeg/J3S1zE6NTIdDie-WToTWAZIa2OGuZ8xLnNK0Z5zStGc\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297024946638848921806.jpeg/62HSACkY47bEbrtm_2-L8WArEE8cfz4HmUYUOZlGFDk\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297027287191552135687.jpeg/Y4sMhKmwn9HTpRwQuvD2idM7dEGDjAodkozUnJKM1Jw\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297029271228416743689.jpeg/Z4aRblaafOoizzYko2SBKzv_rTpy_-UegMP9g4DD_YM\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297031276236800184302.jpeg/sgwAGdfGz6l6Fwhl5MaR5y6YsLhqgUJtt3zxTLd88Uw\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297010215456768456108.jpeg/0kjd88ClRt1iVnCC-By0ZgBpTElNhgGk5PuIdOT7iHQ\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297012790890496184069.jpeg/5aj9Z-T5mIdKcToAl3xhyXpLWuTNcGqTi1mcXYtZnF0\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211211/546297014904950784523816.jpeg/77lyBnuJUXF-AAguTXxruwaop7yRDab6bYcW7m2HFu4\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>31K正職好累…26歲女考慮改兼2職 過來人勸：小心萬年低薪</p><p>36歲租屋族靠零股存到百萬！台股大漲卻更焦慮 網見持股讚：教科書等級</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T06:59:36.400201+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1493,"images":35,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}